<section class="section section--alt" aria-labelledby="history-title">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our history</p>
    <h2 id="history-title">How we got our name</h2>
    <p>On the night Dr. Martin Luther King Jr. was killed, Robert Kennedy was due to give a campaign speech here. Instead, he broke the news to the crowd and asked them to answer with compassion. Indianapolis stayed peaceful while cities across the country burned, and the neighborhood takes its name from that night.</p>
    <a class="more-link" href="/history/">Read our history</a>
  </div>
</section>

